@startuml SSD_EditSNSUser
title SSD: UC13 - Edit SNS User Contact Info

actor "Receptionist" as Rec
participant ":System" as System

autonumber
activate Rec

Rec -> System: starts editing contact information for an SNS user
activate System
System --> Rec: requests SNS User Number
deactivate System

Rec -> System: inputs SNS User Number
activate System
System --> Rec: shows current contact info (Address, Phone) and requests new data
deactivate System

Rec -> System: inputs new Address and Phone
activate System

alt valid data
    System --> Rec: confirms successful update of the SNS user
else invalid data or SNS user not found
    System --> Rec: informs validation error
end

deactivate System
deactivate Rec
@enduml
